     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Normal Physiology Changes of Puerperium *Puerperium: 6-8wk period following birth in which the reproductive tract, as well as the rest of the body, returns to the nonpregnant state *Follow up 4-6wks after delivery recommended for women w/ uncomplicated pregnancies & deliveries"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "slide_card",
    "content": [
