       "marker": null
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Cervix & Vagina"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": null
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "within several hours of delivery, the cervix has reformed – by 1wk it is about 1cm in diameter"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": null
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "round-shaped nulliparous cervix permanently replaced by transverse, fish mouth-shaped external os – result of laceration & dilation during delivery"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
